-- Same 5-House instance as valid-instance.soil, EXCEPT h1's drink is
-- changed from #Water to #Tea (a duplicate of h2's drink) -- the smallest
-- possible single-field change that violates exactly one invariant and
-- nothing else.
--
-- WHY drink, and why h1 specifically: Drink is the one attribute in this
-- model that never appears as the ANTECEDENT of an implication clue (it
-- only ever appears as a CONSEQUENT: Clue04 self.color=Green-> drink=
-- Coffee, Clue05 self.nationality=Ukrainian->drink=Tea, Clue09 self.
-- position=3->drink=Milk, Clue13 self.smoke=LuckyStrike->drink=
-- OrangeJuice). So changing a house's drink can only ever break
-- DistinctDrink -- it can never, by itself, falsify one of those four
-- clues UNLESS the house being edited is itself the antecedent-house for
-- one of them. h1 (Yellow, Norwegian, Kools, position 1) is not Green, not
-- Ukrainian, not at position 3, and does not smoke LuckyStrike, so none of
-- Clue04/05/09/13's antecedents apply to h1 regardless of what its drink
-- is -- this is in fact the same reason h1's drink (Water) was the one
-- value left undetermined until the very last deduction step when solving
-- the puzzle by hand (see valid-instance.soil's header, step 6): it is
-- the puzzle's own "free" drink slot. Overwriting it with h2's Tea
-- therefore isolates DistinctDrink alone.
--
-- Confirmed by actually running this: `check -v' reports DistinctDrink
-- violated (h1 and h2 both now hold #Tea; USE checks a class invariant as
-- one House.allInstances->forAll statement, so this pairwise clash counts
-- as ONE failing invariant, not two) and all other 21 invariants OK,
-- finishing with "checked 22 invariants ..., 1 failure.".

!create h1 : House
!set h1.position := 1
!set h1.color := #Yellow
!set h1.nationality := #Norwegian
!set h1.drink := #Tea
!set h1.smoke := #Kools
!set h1.pet := #Fox

!create h2 : House
!set h2.position := 2
!set h2.color := #Blue
!set h2.nationality := #Ukrainian
!set h2.drink := #Tea
!set h2.smoke := #Chesterfields
!set h2.pet := #Horse

!create h3 : House
!set h3.position := 3
!set h3.color := #Red
!set h3.nationality := #Englishman
!set h3.drink := #Milk
!set h3.smoke := #OldGold
!set h3.pet := #Snails

!create h4 : House
!set h4.position := 4
!set h4.color := #Ivory
!set h4.nationality := #Spaniard
!set h4.drink := #OrangeJuice
!set h4.smoke := #LuckyStrike
!set h4.pet := #Dog

!create h5 : House
!set h5.position := 5
!set h5.color := #Green
!set h5.nationality := #Japanese
!set h5.drink := #Coffee
!set h5.smoke := #Parliaments
!set h5.pet := #Zebra
